   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Regurgitation</em></p>\n<p>You have learned to more accurately extract the cursed energy from a corpse that is required for your technique. You can now devour a corpse as an action for 3 cursed energy that has been dead for a number of days equal to your Cursed Energy modifier and still have it usable for your technique if the creature’s CR equals your level. This increases to twice your Cursed Energy modifier at 11th level and three times at 18th level.</p>",
